  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[Its sting hurts, but death is strangely painless.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Sa piqûre fait mal, mais la mort est ensuite étrangement sans douleur.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Su picadura duele, pero la muerte es curiosamente indolora.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Der Stich tut weh, der Tod ist dagegen schmerzlos.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Il suo pungiglione fa male, ma la morte è stranamente indolore.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[刺されれば痛むが、死は奇妙なほどに痛みを伴わない。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[전갈의 독침은 아프지만, 묘하게도 고통 없이 죽는다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Он больно жалит, но смерть, как ни странно, наступает легко.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[A ferroada dói, mas a morte é estranhamente indolor.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[螫起人来很痛，带来的死亡却意外地无痛。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[螫起人來很痛，帶來的死亡卻意外地無痛。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
